{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/57e07f4334abeea62a36e54fe08e9fed.poster.avif?t=1766168824\" width=1082 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/57e07f4334abeea62a36e54fe08e9fed.webm?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/57e07f4334abeea62a36e54fe08e9fed.mp4?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paddle Legends is a fast-paced roguelite game that reimagines a classic retro arcade-style game into something chaotic, strategic, and endlessly replayable. Every run tests your reflexes, decision-making, and ability to adapt as you use a variety of projectiles, levels with a variety of modifiers, and escalating challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Paddle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a variety of unique paddles, each with its own stats, playstyle, and signature ball types. Some are built for defense, others for damage, and a few harder-to-get paddles can alter how you play the game. Finding your favorite paddle is only the beginning; learning how to use it to its full potential is where the game shines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/25b1a4c8f561b5575b505ea4e1cd1e8f.poster.avif?t=1766168824\" width=1000 height=744 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/25b1a4c8f561b5575b505ea4e1cd1e8f.webm?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/25b1a4c8f561b5575b505ea4e1cd1e8f.mp4?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve Every Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pick an upgrade at the end of each match or get a random upgrade if you manage to hit a chest during battle. Upgrades can enhance your paddle's speed or size, while others will augment your ball with new powers. These upgrades can make each run feel fresh, while also making you feel more powerful the further you make it in a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/47e29f5454133a5381301d8fb198efa1.poster.avif?t=1766168824\" width=866 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/47e29f5454133a5381301d8fb198efa1.webm?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/47e29f5454133a5381301d8fb198efa1.mp4?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Become a Paddle Legend?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through three  campaigns, each featuring its own levels, obstacles, and bosses that shake up how you approach every encounter. When you\u2019re ready for a greater challenge, jump into Endless Mode, where difficulty and rewards scale as you push the limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/ad6196db4fc6b083809f107ddc960fd6.poster.avif?t=1766168824\" width=1086 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/ad6196db4fc6b083809f107ddc960fd6.webm?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/ad6196db4fc6b083809f107ddc960fd6.mp4?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Over is Just the Beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when a run ends, your power can grow. During a run, you will earn credits that you can use to permanently enhance your stats, like size, speed, and health, to name a few. Every Game Over is just a stepping stone to becoming a Paddle Legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression with endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique paddles with distinct stats, styles, and a signature ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three campaigns with unique levels, obstacles, and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level modifiers that keep each run fresh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary mid-run upgrades from chests and level completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades that you can purchase after a run ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of fast reflex gameplay and build crafting</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076450?t=1766168824","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/411573bb522967d15fc0a9c2bb05cb0c1d8eaf1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766168824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/0d957b511b414e8e557e7e132b950215f92da88e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766168824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/0d957b511b414e8e557e7e132b950215f92da88e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766168824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/57e07f4334abeea62a36e54fe08e9fed.poster.avif?t=1766168824\" width=1082 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/57e07f4334abeea62a36e54fe08e9fed.webm?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/57e07f4334abeea62a36e54fe08e9fed.mp4?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paddle Legends is a fast-paced roguelite game that reimagines a classic retro arcade-style game into something chaotic, strategic, and endlessly replayable. Every run tests your reflexes, decision-making, and ability to adapt as you use a variety of projectiles, levels with a variety of modifiers, and escalating challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pick Your Paddle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a variety of unique paddles, each with its own stats, playstyle, and signature ball types. Some are built for defense, others for damage, and a few harder-to-get paddles can alter how you play the game. Finding your favorite paddle is only the beginning; learning how to use it to its full potential is where the game shines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/25b1a4c8f561b5575b505ea4e1cd1e8f.poster.avif?t=1766168824\" width=1000 height=744 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/25b1a4c8f561b5575b505ea4e1cd1e8f.webm?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/25b1a4c8f561b5575b505ea4e1cd1e8f.mp4?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evolve Every Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pick an upgrade at the end of each match or get a random upgrade if you manage to hit a chest during battle. Upgrades can enhance your paddle's speed or size, while others will augment your ball with new powers. These upgrades can make each run feel fresh, while also making you feel more powerful the further you make it in a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/47e29f5454133a5381301d8fb198efa1.poster.avif?t=1766168824\" width=866 height=556 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/47e29f5454133a5381301d8fb198efa1.webm?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/47e29f5454133a5381301d8fb198efa1.mp4?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Become a Paddle Legend?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through three  campaigns, each featuring its own levels, obstacles, and bosses that shake up how you approach every encounter. When you\u2019re ready for a greater challenge, jump into Endless Mode, where difficulty and rewards scale as you push the limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/ad6196db4fc6b083809f107ddc960fd6.poster.avif?t=1766168824\" width=1086 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/ad6196db4fc6b083809f107ddc960fd6.webm?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/extras/ad6196db4fc6b083809f107ddc960fd6.mp4?t=1766168824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Over is Just the Beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when a run ends, your power can grow. During a run, you will earn credits that you can use to permanently enhance your stats, like size, speed, and health, to name a few. Every Game Over is just a stepping stone to becoming a Paddle Legend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression with endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique paddles with distinct stats, styles, and a signature ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three campaigns with unique levels, obstacles, and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level modifiers that keep each run fresh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporary mid-run upgrades from chests and level completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent upgrades that you can purchase after a run ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of fast reflex gameplay and build crafting</p></li></ul>","developers":["glasshalfmoon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076450/33369f8e3b6fc4719bc336ebd3193b3d6abe4910/header.jpg?t=1766168824","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Reco